      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start and accurate, but to be honest, it's scoring really low in the system—like, nearly bottom of the pile—because it's just too brief for the library requirements. \n\ncan you expand on this? i need you to go much deeper into the mathematical derivation and the physical implications (maybe mention the wave packet aspect or the Fourier transform relationship). i really need the length to increase significantly so it actually meets the minimum threshold for the students, but again, please just make sure it's actually substantive and doesn't just repeat the same thing over and over.",
